WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.500
The employee asks about an old leave rule.

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.240
The assistant gives the current rule and cites its policy, version and section.

3
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.700
The assistant logs the general question in HR's unmonitored queue.

4
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.420
An automated test writes HR's answer and marks it approved.

5
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:44.640
An automation copies the approved answer to the board the assistant reads.

6
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:53.340
The retained reply quotes the approved answer and HRQ-050 reference.

7
00:00:53.340 --> 00:01:07.280
An automated test withdrew HRQ-050. Its text remains visible for history.

8
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.040
The withdrawn answer is gone; HRQ-051 logs the question without alerting HR.
